<title>Nigeria: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/nigeria/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-nigeria-2026-10-31T22:38:39.504Z</guid>
<pubDate>Sat, 31 Oct 2026 22:38:39 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Bandits launched attacks on communities in Zamfara, including Bukuyum, where police repelled the assault and discovered over 30 bodies of suspected bandits. In Borno, the federal government mourned 15 farmers killed and in Plateau a soldier sustained machete wounds while two civilians suffered gunshot injuries during a community attack. Three abducted imams were freed after seven weeks of captivity in Zamfara, and a curfew imposed in Benue’s Gboko resulted in one death. The conflict produced 1,486 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiiwFBVV95cUxOS0pRYm84Z1lZU1BfY29hUExsd2VCaHl2X2xqbFZDcHJUeGJOZnR6dG1oLVJkdUl2Tm5yN29sY0VUT0EyZW9jTUNhUUVlbXl5amdnekhHYUlhMlUzZjJ4Qno2SnpGeGV5b2tHWmhha2JQM1F2YzRvQlA5aGlkNXF0X2lvd0xwSmdaS0VR?oc=5&quot;&gt;AIT LIVE&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMikwFBVV95cUxPNHBLY3RmaEdIcXhrQXp4dzlheTZRai1yZS1CZjRfY004U25OT3BiYS1YUlBVbWV3d2tNanlTaDNjaDhGOFVjM2RhZEZzWk9xVDNUUmFKX1dxT00xdVFBZDJKZUxBak1JQVppYVNNTFNQM3hxZEtoLXJOVG01TUFHeGc4a0c4YWNmVjVxZDdNOE0yNkk?oc=5&quot;&gt;LEADERSHIP Newspapers&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiwgFBVV95cUxOd21oQjZndUR6WUgwMXl4TEhWZmJxSkFYSGdySUQ1Q2VSdUg0bTBETUY3dlNGVEZUaUcwemhfbTFpNUQzbEZVaHpybmhKRlljajhzNFJ2eEN4aWJPQmFrODBzblpkMUJMekV6eG1oN1BYWFdXWjRsUDJRSHRiQzl5bS1mQlEyaVBoV3FOdWdCMHZja2dUSU1fakktYVFHejdNekYxS2FDOS1HR3d4LVRMWERWZGlnN3ZkTThzS1YtV3B2Zw?oc=5&quot;&gt;Sahara Reporters&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiiAFBVV95cUxPcG1WNFFwak9aalBtcTZjWmxhRzF5VUZ3RUhkVmlWa0t4ZkN1Qnd0YWRka2lmWFFnbFlEVlpmY3Z2RGFEWHk5VkR4LVBXQm1IUXdhcUJRVTFiXzgyYU1scnhlUzJhQ3F1SHBNSVl6MVVqdzlhX1JrbjNUWTJ6SEFTRzdpRUpZTDZB?oc=5&quot;&gt;Peoples Gazette Nigeria&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rs